<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gucci started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gucci started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Faye Landes started coverage of Gucci Group NV as buy, her office confirmed.</p>
<p>-- No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 70-3/8 in U.S. trading Monday.</p>
